msgid ""
"The :prop_tgt:`XCODE_EMBED_<type>` target property now supports :manual:"
"`generator expressions <cmake-generator-expressions(7)>`. Because Xcode "
"shares one copy-files build phase across all configurations, an expression "
"whose result depends on the configuration is rejected with an error."
